# UART State Machine

## Goal

Learn how to design a Finite State Machine for a UART transmitter and understand how state machines control serial communication.

This project focuses only on the control logic of the UART transmitter, not a complete UART implementation.

## Concepts Learned

- finite state machine (FSM)
- UART
- serial communication
- state transitions
- start bit
- data bits
- stop bit
- bit counter
- clock
- sequential logic
- control logic

## UART Frame

A basic UART transmission consists of:

Idle → Start Bit → Data Bits → Stop Bit → Idle

The data is transmitted one bit at a time, starting with the least significant bit (LSB).

## State Diagram

