## State Table

| Current State | Condition | Next State |
|---------------|-----------|------------|
| IDLE | Start transmission |   START    |
| START | Bit period complete |   DATA   |
| DATA | More bits remain |     DATA     |
| DATA | Last bit transmitted |   STOP   |
| STOP | Bit period complete |    IDLE   |

